From: =?UTF-8?q?Maciej=20=C5=BBenczykowski?= <maze@google.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Apr 2024 03:14:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] bpfloader: prog names are only valid on 4.15+
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The following commit is only in 4.15:

  commit cb4d2b3f03d8eed90be3a194e5b54b734ec4bbe9
  Author: Martin KaFai Lau <kafai@fb.com>
  Date:   Wed Sep 27 14:37:52 2017 -0700

    bpf: Add name, load_time, uid and map_ids to bpf_prog_info

  $ git describe cb4d2b3f03d8eed90be3a194e5b54b734ec4bbe9
  v4.14-rc1-661-gcb4d2b3f03d8

Bug: 335390828
Test: TreeHugger
Signed-off-by: Maciej Żenczykowski <maze@google.com>
Change-Id: I246a7a8640bea1e939f12f3ffd3fedc25a0a6422
---
 loader/Loader.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/loader/Loader.cpp b/loader/Loader.cpp
index c92f53b..fec8fac 100644
--- a/loader/Loader.cpp
+++ b/loader/Loader.cpp
@@ -780,7 +780,7 @@ static int loadCodeSections(const char* elfPath, vector<codeSection>& cs, const
               .log_buf = ptr_to_u64(log_buf.data()),
               .log_size = static_cast<__u32>(log_buf.size()),
             };
-            if (isAtLeastKernelVersion(4, 14, 0))
+            if (isAtLeastKernelVersion(4, 15, 0))
                 strlcpy(req.prog_name, cs[i].name.c_str(), sizeof(req.prog_name));
             fd.reset(bpf(BPF_PROG_LOAD, req));
 
-- 
